{
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_112": "Received \"Cereza in Wonderland\" \r\ncostume.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_101": "Select \"Costumes\" in a Sanctuary \r\nto change Cereza and Cheshire's \r\nappearance.",
  "AC_NARRATION235_0010": "The churning waters of this waterfall \r\nflowed to meet Lake Nimueh.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_4020": "Cereza finds that Cheshire \r\nhas been caught by the \r\nfaeries. Putting their quarrels\r\naside, she infiltrates the \r\nfaerie fortress with some \r\nhelp from the white wolf.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_71_FAS": "Salutations, Cereza. \r\nFinding those wolf tracks okay?",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_23": "Obstruction",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_30": "Resentment",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CHESHIRE_TXT_04": "Unlock requirements:\r\nLearn skills with Cheshire and...",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_11_COL": "We're having a blast here thanks to you.\r\nWhy don't you stay and play for a bit?",
  "CORE_SNPSS_6010": "Double-crossed by Lukaon, \r\nCereza and Cheshire work \r\ntogether to stop him. After \r\ncoming to his senses, \r\nLukaon helps the two\r\nfind a way out of the forest.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0039_001_H39": "*Cough, cough* Sorry...\r\nfeeling a bit under the weather. \r\nDo you have any medicine?",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0026": "Style is everything darling,\r\neven in Avalon. I want a flower\r\nthat brings out my true colour.",
  "AC_NARRATION260_0010": "Having saved so many wisps, Cereza and Cheshire \r\nhad become heroes among Avalon's downtrodden.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_04_COL": "Wow, a lot of wisps have made it back!\r\nAll thanks to you and that umm...\r\nFriend of yours!",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_06": "Exit the Tír na nÓg.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0023_001_H23": "Oh...I'm ever so hungry...\r\nFood...food...where are you...?",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_64_FAS": "Think of me as your Avalon guide. I'll\r\ntake you to anywhere you'd like to go.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_3030": "After a tense battle, Cereza \r\nand Cheshire defeat the \r\nJabberwock. With the \r\nguidance of the white wolf, \r\nthey set off for the shrine \r\nholding the Elemental Core.",
  "CORE_SVSLT_TXT_02": "Select a file to load.",
  "AC_CEREZA040_0010": "Nobody likes you.\r\nYou really think you can become a great witch?",
  "CORE_SNPSS_1000": "Cereza continues making\r\nher way through the\r\nuninviting realm.\r\nShe seems to be in a \r\nhurry, for some reason...",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0013_002_H13": "I can hear it, ya know...the voices, \r\ncalling me to the dimension beyond here.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_28_H14": "Yay, now I'm finally free! I'm gonna \r\nget back and make a big meal!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0021_002_H21": "Feather in your cap and all that...\r\nThat's the road to greatness!",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_02": "Check the game's tutorials.",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_11": "Continue from where you \r\nlast saved.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_17_H03": "You saved me...I give you my gratitude.\r\nOkay! Let's get this gate open, shall we?",
  "TA_9011_0010_COL": "Be careful, sis!",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_005": "This will delete the file \r\nin this slot.\r\nProceed?",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_116": "Received \"Arch-Eve Origin\", \r\n\"Jeanne\" and \"Charles\" costumes.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_105": "Close the Costumes menu?",
  "CORE_HAIR_CERESSA_TXT_03": "Resolved",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_27": "Imprecation",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_34": "Blinding Dark",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_21_COL": "If you find any wisps, tell them \r\nto come here. I'm sure they'd be \r\nlost and scared alone.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_21_H07": "Great, I can move again!\r\nThanks, sis! This is great!!",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_13_H00": "*Shivers* Something doesn't sit right...\r\nThink it'd be okay for us to wait here?",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0004_002_H04": "Geez...I'm so scared the faeries'll come \r\nat any time...you've gotta give me \r\nsomething to help me hide!",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_150": "Please select the settings \r\nyou prefer for vitality. \r\n\"Less\" will decrease damage, and \r\n\"None\" will negate damage entirely.",
  "TA_COM030_0010_CER": "Hmph!",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0039": "I don't feel too well.\r\nDo you have anything for a cold?",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_18_COL": "Oh! Cereza, Mr. Cheshire!\r\nThanks for saving everyone!",
  "TA_COM030_0020_CER": "Hey!",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_154": "If you find Witch Pulse to be a bit\r\ntoo difficult, you can change your\r\nsettings so that Cereza will perform\r\nit on her own. Which would you prefer?",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_25_H11": "Thanks for your help! \r\nNow let's get out of here!",
  "CORE_ARCHIVE_TXT_03": "Journals found throughout the forest.",
  "AC_CEREZA130_0010": "That's not true!",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_02_COL": "If you find more of our friends, be sure\r\nto tell them about this place. They'll be\r\nlost by themselves, you know.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_32_H18": "*Gasp* Thanks for the help!\r\nThose darn faeries...I'll show them!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0029_003_H29": "This medicine...Hmmm...Is it...?\r\nYou know, this might \r\nwake me up some.",
  "AC_NARRATION225_0020": "What waited for them beyond, they could not imagine.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0034_001_H34": "Eck, my throat is so sore...\r\nhave anything that might help?",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_38": "Calamity - Trial",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_17_COL": "Here, this is for you.\r\nI hope you find it useful.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0006_001_H06": "Do you have anything I could use\r\nas maybe a needle...substitute?\r\nJust needs to be pointy.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_2010": "Cereza and Cheshire meet \r\nColm, a wisp whose friends \r\nwere abducted by faeries. \r\nAfter arguing with Cheshire,\r\nCereza sets off alone \r\nto rescue them. ",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_009": "Move to this area?",
  "CORE_SNPSS_0020": "Trusting the words of the boy \r\nfrom her dreams, Cereza goes \r\nagainst her teacher's warnings\r\nand sets off into the great \r\nforest unknown, trying to put \r\nher fears aside.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_30_H16": "Thanks, you helped me out. I heard\r\nthere are a lot of my friends in the tower, too...",
  "AC_CEREZA035_0010": "Give up already.\r\nYou'll never change.",
  "TA_COM000_0010_CER": "Hmm?",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0029": "Sigh...too bored to go on...\r\nSomeone give me some stimulation...",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_15_H01": "*Yawn* Thanks for the help.\r\nI'm gonna...find a place for a nap.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_153": "Choose settings for enemy difficulty.\r\n\"Weak\" makes enemies less aggressive and reduces\r\nthe frequency of attacks. \"Pushover\" also reduces \r\nthe number of enemies that appear in battle.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_140": "Review game instructions thus \r\nfar via the Travel Wisdom menu? \r\n*Travel Wisdom can be accessed\r\nany time from the System menu.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_5010": "Cereza succeeds in calming \r\nCheshire after he is put under\r\na spell by Púca. Reaffirming \r\nthe bond grown between them,\r\nthey hurry to find Lukaon.",
  "CORE_ARCHIVE_TXT_04": "Memories made along your journey.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0032_001_H32": "Colm always is doing his best - I want\r\nto do something in return. Got anything?",
  "TA_COM000_0020_CER": "What's this...?",
  "AC_NARRATION240_0010": "Clear, glistening water, ever-flowing, \r\nbrought life to all of Avalon Forest.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_23_H09": "Thanks so, so much for your help.\r\nNow careful not to fall for my charms.",
  "AC_NARRATION215_0010": "The secret base of the wisps,\r\ntucked away in the forest.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_28": "Bordering Death",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0028_001_H28": "If I can just take the pain, \r\nthose faeries won't be scary any more! \r\nSo, please, show me...",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_119": "Received \"A Blundering Witch\" \r\ncostume.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_14_02_H16": "There are lots of faeries inside but...\r\nGee, I hope everyone's okay...",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0017_001_H17": "The big catch! Big, big fish!\r\nYou, witch lady! Gimme some bait, will ya?",
  "AC_NARRATION250_0020": "Enjoying the warm sand and cool breeze,\r\nCereza thought perhaps there was some\r\nkindness in faerie hearts after all.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_011": "Cannot travel to selected \r\narea right now.",
  "AC_CEREZA145_0010": "Stop, stop talking!",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_002": "Previous save data exists \r\nin this slot.\r\nOkay to overwrite it?",
  "CORE_HAIR_CERESSA_TXT_04": "A New Chapter",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_111": "Received  \"An Elegant Swan\" \r\ncostume.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_102": "Change Cereza's costume?",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_62_COL": "I'm so glad everyone's safe...\r\nThank you so much, Cereza!",
  "CORE_SNPSS_4030": "Rescuing a badly hurt \r\nCheshire, the two are \r\nfinally reunited. \r\nThe white wolf \r\ndisappears deep\r\ninside the fortress, and \r\nthe two chase after.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_20": "Breakthrough",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_33": "Cursed Chains",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_05": "Restart from the last \r\ncheckpoint inside the \r\nTír na nÓg.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_1010": "Still hurt over parting from \r\nher mother Rosa, Cereza \r\napprenticed with the witch \r\nMorgana, training daily to \r\nbecome a powerful witch \r\nherself.",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0032": "I want to give something that'll cheer\r\nmy friend up. Could you help?",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0021": "I call for décor that \r\naccentuates my already \r\nsuave persona. What have you?",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_01": "Adjust various game settings.",
  "AC_IGNIS005_0010": "Hello. In need of my services?\r\nLeave any secret pathways to me!",
  "CORE_SNPSS_3020": "Thanks to Cereza's quick \r\nthinking, the two are able \r\nto drive the monster \r\naway. Now a bit more \r\nconfident, she and Cheshire \r\nresume their search for \r\nthe cores.",
  "CORE_SVSLT_TXT_01": "Select a slot to save.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_115": "Received \"The Right Eye\" and\r\n\"Observer of Time\" costumes.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_24": "In a Flash",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_37": "Sleet & Hail",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0015_002_H15": "Hi, just jotting something\r\ndown about this plant, hold on...",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CHESHIRE_TXT_03": "Unlock requirements:\r\nFind all Tír na nÓg treasures and...",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_006": "Once deleted, the file cannot \r\nbe restored. Is it really okay \r\nto delete this file?",
  "CORE_MISSION_TEXT_0007": "Overcome all obstacles and\r\nconquer the Tír na nÓg!",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CHESHIRE_TXT_03": "I just need my hat and I'll be \r\nright as rain. Don't worry about \r\nthose folk that call me mad!",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_160": "Would you like to turn tutorials\r\noff for your current playthrough?\r\nYou can turn them back on any\r\ntime from the Options menu.",
  "AC_CEREZA060_0030": "Wrong way.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0008_001_H08": "I want power - strong enough to stand\r\nup to any faerie I see! Can you help?",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_51": "Resentment - Trial",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_42": "Off The Rails - Trial",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CERESSA_TXT_04": "Unlock requirements:\r\nLearn skills with Cereza and...",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_10": "Ohh...I'm glad I got away,\r\nbut I'm no good with high places...",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_03": "Sis, thank you!\r\nFollow me and I'll open the gate!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0015_003_H15": "This, this is Mandragora! \r\nAnd it's in great condition! \r\nI've got to research this further!",
  "AC_CEREZA050_0010": "You can't do anything on your own.\r\nBut hey, someone'll come along to save you, right?",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_44_H30": "To be caught...oh, for shame!\r\nNow it's my turn to protect everyone!",
  "CORE_TITLE_TEXT_00": "[BTN:L2 ] + [BTN:R2 ]",
  "CORE_SNPSS_0010": "Still hurt over parting from \r\nher mother Rosa, Cereza \r\napprenticed with the witch \r\nMorgana, training daily to \r\nbecome a powerful witch \r\nherself.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_08": "Revengeance",
  "CORE_SNPSS_2020": "Reunited, Cereza and \r\nCheshire find Faerieland \r\nTower, where the wisps were\r\nbeing tormented. They make \r\ntheir way inside.",
  "CORE_NPC_TXT_11": "Use compounds to concoct \r\nitems.",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_07": "Be careful up ahead!\r\nThere's this really scary circus!",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_55": "Eerie Light - Trial",
  "AC_NARRATION225_0010": "All of the Elemental Cores were destroyed, \r\nand their barriers were no more.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_46": "Stomping Grounds - Trial",
  "CORE_MISSION_TEXT_0003": "Any enemy attack proves fatal!\r\nDefeat all enemies without getting hit!",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_34_H20": "Blegh, I ache all over. \r\nThanks for the help, witch lady.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_54_H40": "Behold, I once again am brought \r\nto this time. Now life is mine \r\nagain to live...",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_090": "Select a slot to save your clear\r\ndata in. You can still play from this\r\nfile to find more secrets or\r\ncomplete unfinished areas.",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CERESSA_TXT_08": "Unlock requirements:\r\nSee all of Jeanne's heroics and...",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_14_H16": "If we can just drop this lever, you \r\nshould be able to get in the tower!",
  "CORE_BAND_CHESHIRE_TXT_02": "Strong Arm",
  "AC_NARRATION260_0020": "The peaceful inhabitants of the forest would sing \r\ntales of their bravery for years to come. The kind-\r\nhearted witch and her steadfast demon companion.",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_07": "A strong but kind witch, racing \r\nto save her friend. Whatever \r\ncomes, tomorrow is surely hers.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_031": "Exit Tír na nÓg?",
  "TA_COM025_0020_CER": "Okay!",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_14_03_H16": "I heard you helped my friends!\r\nI've got to hurry and tell the others...",
  "CORE_SNPSS_6020": "Púca brings about an army \r\nof faeries to stop Cereza. \r\nCheshire mounts Cereza on\r\nhis back and the two head \r\ntowards a pillar of light \r\nMorgana has created.",
  "AC_NARRATION235_0020": "Cereza felt small before the \r\ngreat rumble of the rapids.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_49_H35": "Looks like I'm saved, all right!\r\nTime to get back and start inventing.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_4010": "The faeries create an illusion \r\nof Cereza's mother that causes \r\nher and Cheshire to have \r\na big fight. Leaving Cheshire, \r\nCereza makes her way to \r\nthe faeries' fortress alone.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_13": "Bravery",
  "TA_COM025_0010_CER": "Phew!",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_17": "Plunging Down",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_04": "Limitations",
  "CORE_RETRY_TXT_01": "Spend the required items \r\nto unlock this Tír na nÓg?",
  "AC_CEREZA015_0020": "Don't worry, I'll save you.",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_03": "The girl decided to write a book\r\nabout the curiosities of this wondrous \r\nland...if she ever makes it back.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_1030": "Cereza and Cheshire's fateful \r\nmeeting. The two begin their \r\njourney in search of the white \r\nwolf, who is said to be able\r\nto give them incredible power \r\nthat might hopefully help \r\nCereza send Cheshire back \r\nto his home of Inferno.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0037_001_H37": "I like the tranquillity here, but sometimes\r\nI'd like a change of pace. Any...ideas?",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_39_H25": "C-c-c-cold! Thought I was gonna \r\nbecome an icicle! Thanks! \r\nI'll get those faeries someday...",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0006": "I wish I had a needle for sewing.\r\nDo you happen to know where one is?",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0015": "It's been too long since I've\r\ndone decent plant research.\r\nThink you could lend a hand?",
  "CORE_BAND_CHESHIRE_TXT_01": "Default",
  "CORE_MISSION_TEXT_0008": "Defeat all enemy faeries!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0029_002_H29": "After those faeries caught me...\r\nIt's just too meh to do anything.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_03_COL": "Those faeries...\r\nI really wonder how they can be so cruel.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_19_COL": "Everyone wants to share their thanks.\r\nHey everybody, come on!",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_63_FAS": "Cereza. If you ever are lost in the forest,\r\njust ask me for help.",
  "CORE_NPC_TXT_09": "Retry a Tír na nÓg or play \r\nits time trial.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_121": "Received \"Observer of Time\"\r\ncostume.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_10": "Illusion",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_03": "Calamity",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_16_COL": "Cereza, Cheshire, thanks for everything!\r\nHere's a showing of my gratitude.",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_04": "“You dummie, get me back to Inferno\r\nat once or I'll chomp you to pieces!”\r\nPretty convincing, don't you think?",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_021": "Begin concocting?",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_032": "Start Tír na nÓg over?\r\n(Current progress will be lost.)",
  "CORE_SNPSS_6030": "Morgana reveals her true \r\nintentions to sacrifice \r\nCheshire to save her \r\nson's life. Cereza gathers \r\nher courage to stand against\r\nthe one who once was \r\nher teacher.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_36_H22": "I...I can move again?\r\nYou're the one who saved me...thanks!",
  "AC_NARRATION250_0010": "A dazzling grove with gently lapping waves; \r\na striking contrast to the eerie Avalon Forest.",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_12_H00": "Uggh! Ah, so close! I think we\r\njust need one more wisp!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0004_003_H04": "Thanks, you saved me big time.\r\nWait, a hideaway? Where is it?\r\nThat sounds way safer than here!",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_14": "Critical",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_07": "Puncture",
  "TA_COM015_0010_CER": "That's it!",
  "CORE_RETRY_TXT_02": "Retry this Tír na nÓg?",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_08": "If the ringleader finds you, it's all over...\r\nBe careful, sis...",
  "CORE_SNPSS_3010": "The duo are ambushed by \r\na monster with armour that \r\nproves Cheshire's claws\r\nmeaningless. Struck with \r\nfear, Cereza dashes away \r\nin the forest to hide.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_49": "Compression - Trial",
  "CORE_SNPSS_1020": "Trusting the words of the boy \r\nfrom her dreams, Cereza goes \r\nagainst her teacher's warnings\r\nand sets off into the great \r\nforest unknown, trying to put \r\nher fears aside.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0013_003_H13": "Heh...I'm thrilled! You actually got it.\r\nThanks for helping me out, sis.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0026_001_H26": "No matter your situation, you mustn't \r\nforget beauty. So you - bring me \r\na flower when you have time.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_170": "In Jeanne's Tale, the game will\r\nsave automatically at certain\r\npoints. Please note that manual\r\nsaving is not available.",
  "AC_CEREZA060_0020": "You're helpless. It's not even funny.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_52": "Protection - Trial",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_41": "Puncture - Trial",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CERESSA_TXT_07": "Unlock requirements:\r\nFinish the Forbidden Tale and...",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0021_003_H21": "Wow, wonderful! Just what I want!\r\nI'm speechless! I'm going to \r\nshow off to everybody!",
  "CORE_NPC_TXT_05": "Save the progress of your game.",
  "CORE_MISSION_TEXT_0004": "Enemies leave curses when defeated -\r\navoid these traps and defeat them all!",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_20_COL": "There are still more wisps in the forest.\r\nPlease, you've got to help!",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_08": "After standing against all odds and\r\nfinding my true self, I'll surely be\r\nreunited with my only prince.",
  "AC_IGNIS015_0010": "Your forest travels going okay?\r\nIf you want me to take you \r\non a secret pathway, just say.",
  "AC_NARRATION215_0020": "Thanks to Cereza and Cheshire, \r\nplayful shouts of joy had begun to return.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_18": "Stomping Grounds",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_10_COL": "Cereza, and your cat friend! \r\nHow've you been? I've missed you.",
  "CORE_ARCHIVE_TXT_99": "This has yet to be unlocked.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_2030": "Cereza and Cheshire save \r\nColm's friends from the \r\nfaeries. After a joyful wisp \r\nreunion, the duo follow after \r\ntheir newfound companions.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_70_FAS": "If you ever get lost, look for the white\r\nwolf's tracks. He's as good a guide as I.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_65_FAS": "Have you found some wolf tracks?\r\nI could take you near some, if you'd like.",
  "AC_CEREZA155_0010": "Stop it...Please!",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CHESHIRE_TXT_04": "[FONT:10 ]I'm gonna, gonna be a strong witch \r\nand, save my mummy and stuff!\r\nHmph, perfect impression.[FONT:N ]",
  "AC_NARRATION240_0020": "Cereza and Cheshire drank their \r\nfill and felt immediately refreshed.",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_04": "Thought I was going to get a longer neck!\r\nLook out for those faeries, sis!",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CERESSA_TXT_03": "Unlock requirements:\r\nPerform well in time trials and...",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_45": "Plunging Down - Trial",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_05_COL": "Recently we've been taking turns \r\nstanding guard. Can't let those faeries \r\nfind our hideaway!",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_22_COL": "Sorry to always ask you for help.\r\nBut if you can, please do save our friends.",
  "CORE_BAND_CHESHIRE_TXT_04": "Bandage of Bonds",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_58_FAS": "Be careful of the faeries. \r\nThey don't know the meaning of mercy.",
  "AC_IGNIS200_0010_0020": "The secret path awaits...",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_09": "I'll be hiding here.\r\nDon't tell anyone!",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_48": "Evasion - Trial",
  "AC_CEREZA030_0010": "What a coward. You're destined to fail!",
  "CORE_SNPSS_2060": "After destroying the second \r\nElemental Core, Cereza and \r\nCheshire test out their newly\r\nacquired powers while again \r\nchasing after the white wolf.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0021_001_H21": "I loathe always hiding...give me something\r\nthat lets me step out in the bright lights,\r\nthat can truly make me shine!",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_57_FAS": "Better get your climbing gear \r\nand your swimsuit...You've got \r\na lot of work ahead of you.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_15": "Restraint",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_06": "Pursuance",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0013_001_H13": "Heh...Sis. Help me out, okay? \r\nThis is something that's going\r\nto be really far out, trust me.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0026_003_H26": "Oh, you amazing witch!\r\nI could just kiss you!",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_01": "A young witch journeying to Avalon\r\nin hopes of saving her mother\r\nhas a fateful meeting with a demon.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_6035": "Cereza witnesses the ends \r\nof Morgana and Lukaon, \r\nboth victims of a cruel and \r\ntragic fate. She turns \r\nto Cheshire to say \r\none last goodbye, \r\nand finally...",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_05": "Some clothes Cereza has now grown\r\nout of. She still remembers that\r\nsearch for her mummy vividly.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_033": "Start Tír na nÓg over?",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_67_FAS": "The white wolf seems to be a bit far.\r\nNot a problem for lil' old Ignis!",
  "AC_NARRATION245_0010": "The ravages of time had not been kind to this palace, but they were unable to completely erase its former majesty.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_07_COL": "The hideaway is bustling! I hope we\r\ncan make it a place where all \r\nwisps are safe.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_120": "Received \"The Right Eye\"\r\ncostume.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0023_002_H23": "Please...you'll find some\r\nfood for my little tummy, right...?",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_11": "Off The Rails",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_02": "Prison of Thorns",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0039_002_H39": "*Wheeze* Thought I wouldn't get sick\r\nany more if I was a wisp...",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_68_FAS": "It's easy to get lost in Avalon Forest...\r\nshall I lead you near the white wolf?",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_12_COL": "I've been working out, can you tell?\r\nCan't have those faeries push \r\nme around forever!",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_24_H10": "Thanks um...babe. \r\nI'll stick with you a bit.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_08_COL": "Did you hear we started a patrol unit!?\r\nI mean, we can't actually fight \r\nthe faeries, but...",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_33_H19": "Thanks, only took you...\r\n34,506,250 seconds to save me.",
  "AC_NARRATION210_0010": "A gigantic tower built by the faeries.\r\nStrange contraptions were scattered about its base.",
  "AC_NARRATION255_0020": "Just how long would it take for this many to grow?\r\nThey stood in awe of the forest's diligent workings.",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_05": "I can't even beat a little one...\r\nWhat good am I...",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CERESSA_TXT_02": "Unlock requirements:\r\nSave enough wisps and...",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_44": "Showdown - Trial",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0006_002_H06": "Mmm...all of these needles are no good...\r\nHow am I supposed to work like this?",
  "CORE_MISSION_TEXT_0001": "Enemies can only be damaged while bound!\r\nUse Thorn Bind and defeat them all!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0034_002_H34": "I'm supposed to be a lookout but...\r\nI can't call for help with a sore throat!",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_14_COL": "The hideaway is even bigger than before!\r\nStop and play for a bit, won't ya?",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CHESHIRE_TXT_05": "Bought at \"Pygmalion\", a designer \r\nstore for trending toys.\r\n*Gameplay switches to Jeanne/Charles.",
  "CORE_COSTUME_TXT_01": "Select a costume to change into.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_1070": "Destroying the first Elemental \r\nCore, Cereza and Cheshire \r\ncontinue into the depths\r\nof the forest to find the \r\nremaining three.",
  "TA_COM020_0010_CER": "Aww...",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_01_COL": "Hey, Cereza. \r\nDid you find any more of our friends?",
  "AC_NARRATION200_0020": "She could feel the whisper of a mysterious power, \r\ncarried by the wind from further within.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_19": "Dark Projection",
  "CORE_SNPSS_3040": "Cereza and Cheshire destroy \r\nthe third Elemental Core. \r\nUsing their newly acquired \r\npowers, they make their way \r\nto the final core.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_61_FAS": "I've got a little message from Colm:\r\n\"I wanna see you again! Drop by sometime!\"",
  "CORE_EVENT_PAUSE_TXT_01": "Press [BTN:START ] to resume.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_16_H02": "Thanks. I'm going back to the hideaway \r\nto think up some defence plans.",
  "TA_COM020_0020_CER": "Aww...",
  "AC_IGNIS200_0000_0010": "Don't dawdle now!",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_09": "The traditional wear of an apprentice\r\nwitch, worn by Cereza's worthy rival.\r\n*Gameplay switches to Jeanne/Charles.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0004_001_H04": "Sometimes I feel I just need to hide \r\nfrom it all. Maybe if I used a plant...? \r\nCould you help?",
  "CORE_MISSION_TEXT_0005": "Enemies use barriers! Take them \r\ndown with the right elements!",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CHESHIRE_TXT_01": "A lost demon with a short temper.\r\nEven his newly found body of fluff \r\ncan't contain his wild tendencies.",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_55_COL": "More of us are trapped in that tower...\r\nYou've gotta save them!",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_53": "Skirmish - Trial",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_40": "Pursuance - Trial",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_01": "Thank you, sis!",
  "CORE_SNPSS_4050": "The two succeeded in \r\ndestroying the last core. \r\nWith their new powers, \r\nthe two leave the core's \r\nshrine behind them.",
  "CORE_MISSION_TEXT_0002": "Defeat all enemies before time runs out!\r\nEach enemy defeated extends the limit!",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_19_H05": "Wow, I feel so much lighter!\r\nThanks kitty-kat! I'll see you around!",
  "AC_NARRATION230_0010": "A magnificent tree rose before them.\r\nIts pure-white branches stretched as far as the eye could see.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_091": "Congratulations! You can now:\r\n-Select difficulty starting a new game\r\n-Play a special story with Jeanne\r\n-Access the costumes menu",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0028_002_H28": "Hey, let's make this clear. \r\nIt's not that I actually like pain.\r\nI'm not some kinda masochist.",
  "CORE_NPC_TXT_10": "Change Cereza and Cheshire's \r\ncostumes.",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_06": "My friends all got nabbed away...\r\nNone of them came back...",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_54": "Cursed Chains - Trial",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_47": "Breakthrough - Trial",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_09": "The Jest",
  "CORE_SNPSS_3050": "Cereza and Cheshire discover \r\nthat the final Elemental Core \r\nis inside Púca's Fortress. \r\nFor Lukaon's sake, as well \r\nas her own, Cereza \r\nresolves to break in.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_1060": "Reuniting with Morgana through \r\na magic spell, Cereza is told it \r\nwill take time until she will \r\nbe able to exit the forest. \r\nShe again decides to pursue \r\nthe white wolf.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_26_H12": "Am I...free? I'm scared but...\r\nI've gotta be strong...!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0032_002_H32": "I've been looking for something for him,\r\nand I got lost all the way out here.",
  "TA_COM010_0010_CER": "Hmmmm.",
  "AC_CEREZA045_0010": "Running away as usual?\r\nDoesn't surprise me at all.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0037_003_H37": "Thank...s...ugh...that is a potent smell.\r\nI better get back before any faeries find me.",
  "TA_COM010_0020_CER": "Mmm...",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_50": "Bordering Death - Trial",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_43": "Transportation - Trial",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CERESSA_TXT_05": "Unlock requirements:\r\nCollect enough remembrances and...",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_02": "Follow me! I'll open the gate!",
  "CORE_SNPSS_4040": "After defeating the \r\nself-proclaimed faerie king \r\nPúca and his summoned\r\nangel, Cereza and Cheshire \r\nproceed to the last core.",
  "CORE_MISSION_TEXT_0006": "Rank drops as time passes! Defeat \r\nenemies as quickly as possible!",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CHESHIRE_TXT_02": "The demon cursed the princess\r\nand her pursuit of true love...\r\nCheshire doesn't really get it.",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0008": "I want to be stronger. You're a witch,\r\ncan't you do anything?",
  "CORE_SNPSS_2070": "The two take off after the \r\nthird core, said to be at \r\nthe bottom of Lake Nimueh.\r\nIn order to drain the lake, \r\nCereza must climb the \r\ntallest tree in the forest.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0015_001_H15": "I tell you, this forest truly is full of\r\nwonder...if you happen to come across\r\nany strange plantlife, do tell!",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0013": "I want something to elevate\r\nmyself...to the next plane of\r\nexistence. Help me out, sis...",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_02": "A graceful ballerina playing a princess \r\ncursed to be a white swan.\r\nShe tells her story through dance.",
  "AC_IGNIS020_0010": "Avalon is a dangerous forest.\r\nSecret pathways will likely prove valuable.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0008_003_H08": "Will this make me stronger...? Ugh, \r\nthe stench! I'll go back to the hideaway \r\nand try it...thanks!",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_16": "Showdown",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_05": "Rotation",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_130": "You are approaching the end of this\r\nstory. Are you ready to proceed?",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_12": "Guidance",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_01": "Eerie Light",
  "AC_CEREZA135_0010": "I...I...!",
  "AC_NARRATION220_0020": "Atop its peak the jagged mouth of a massive rift.\r\nWhatever might the faeries be planning inside...?",
  "CORE_COSTUME_CERESSA_TXT_06": "Waking from a 500-year slumber, \r\nshe is first a prisoner of fate,\r\nbut takes control of her destiny.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_030": "Reset your current floor?\r\nYou can keep the items \r\nyou have collected.",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0004": "I'm tired of being scared all the time.\r\nI just want to hide somewhere for good.",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0017": "Good fish need good bait! \r\nThink you could find me any?",
  "CORE_BAND_CHESHIRE_TXT_03": "A Regretful Slip",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CERESSA_TXT_09": "Unlock requirements:\r\nSee all of Jeanne's heroics and...",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0017_002_H17": "The fish around here are fat, \r\nbut they're picky. If I'm not careful, \r\nthey'll make me bait.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_29": "Vehemence",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_118": "Received \"A Mad Hatter\"  \r\ncostume.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_1040": "Cereza and Cheshire find \r\nthe white wolf, but he soon \r\nruns away. They again pursue \r\nhim, going further into the \r\ndepths of the forest.",
  "AC_NARRATION200_0010": "Cereza was surrounded by a crisp, \r\nrefreshing scent coming from the trees.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0017_003_H17": "Thanks witch lady! Now, on with the fis-\r\nWait a minute! I forgot my rod!",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_156": "Having trouble in battle?\r\nConsider changing enemy\r\nstrength or damage taken.",
  "AC_NARRATION255_0010": "Cereza and Cheshire came across a pool where \r\nlily pads stretched as far as the eye could see.",
  "CORE_ARCHIVE_TXT_01": "The characters of this story.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_152": "Choose input method for Bind Combo and Chomp! \r\nUse \"Hold/Release\" for full control of when \r\nyou use them, or have Cheshire use them when \r\navailable with a \"Tap\" of the attack button.",
  "LV_009911_0010_NAR": "It seems that Cheshire intends to stay put,\r\nhis body saying, “Why don't you do it yourself?”",
  "CORE_ARCHIVE_TXT_05": "Wisps you've helped in Avalon.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_4060": "Finally, Cereza and Cheshire \r\nhave destroyed all four of \r\nthe Elemental Cores.\r\nLed by the white wolf, the \r\ntwo make their way \r\nto see Lukaon.",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0028": "Pain...pain! I need pain!\r\nYou there...give me the pain I need!",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_38_H24": "(Cereza tries to listen, \r\nbut it just sounds like noise...)",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0008_002_H08": "I'm a hunter. I should be shooting arrows,\r\nnot being shot at!",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CHESHIRE_TXT_02": "Unlock requirements:\r\nFind enough journals and...",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_114": "Received \"Younger Days\" costume.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_45_H31": "Thank you for helping me.\r\nDo you know...if my plants are safe?",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0037_002_H37": "I'm a workaholic. And Avalon is a scary\r\nforest, so sometimes you just need\r\nsomething to take your mind off, you know?",
  "CORE_HAIR_CERESSA_TXT_01": "Default",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_25": "Compression",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_36": "Imposing Light",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_52_H38": "Finally, reinforcements...glad I held out.\r\nTime to get back into routine...",
  "CORE_SNPSS_2050": "After working together to\r\ndefeat the circus ringmaster \r\nAmadán Dubh, Cereza and\r\nCheshire search the circus \r\ntent for an Elemental Core.",
  "TA_COM035_0020_CER": "Huh??!!",
  "AC_IGNIS010_0010": "How've you been?\r\nI was just about to start \r\na secret pathways tour!",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_00": "Move the cursor and select.",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0037": "I feel like I need a change of pace.\r\nMaybe trying a new smell would\r\ndo the trick...",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_04": "Load a previous save.",
  "AC_NARRATION210_0020": "Its haphazard construction reflected \r\nthe disorder in the faeries' hearts.",
  "TEST_GIMMICK_TALK_01": "There seems to be a seesaw just the size\r\nfor a wisp.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_41_H27": "I saw in a vision...you would save me.\r\nPerhaps...us meeting...is fate?",
  "TA_9012_0010_COL": "Don't get tangled up out there!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0028_003_H28": "Excellent...this is just what I needed!\r\nNow nothing they do can harm me!\r\nI'll see you back at the hideaway!",
  "TA_COM035_0010_CER": "Huh?",
  "AC_CEREZA150_0010": "You're wrong! Shut up!",
  "AC_CEREZA060_0040": "You're taking all day, come on!",
  "AC_NARRATION245_0020": "Cereza remembered hearing that long ago \r\na faerie queen resided in just such a place.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_103": "Change Cheshire's costume?",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0032_003_H32": "Thanks, Colm will love this!\r\nAnyway, guess I'll just zip back\r\nto the hideaway!",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_21": "Acceleration",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_32": "Skirmish",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_010": "Cannot select your current \r\nlocation.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_117": "Received \"Accurser of Love\" \r\ncostume.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_104": "Open the Costumes menu?",
  "CORE_HAIR_CERESSA_TXT_02": "Apprentice Braids",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_26": "Primordial",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_35": "Deliverance",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0023": "I'm...so hungry. Please...give me\r\nsomething good to eat...",
  "AC_CEREZA055_0010": "You're nothing but a big crybaby!\r\nYou're better off sobbing in the shadows!",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_03": "Return to the title screen.",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_11_H00": "Sorry...I think I'll need two more \r\nfriends to open this gate.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_2040": "The wisps guide Cereza \r\nand Cheshire to their secret \r\nhideaway. After resting, \r\nthe two return to the forest \r\nto seek out the remaining \r\ncores.",
  "CORE_SVSLT_TXT_03": "Select a file to delete.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0006_003_H06": "Yes! This is just the pointy-ness I need!\r\nI could make this into a great needle!",
  "TA_COM005_0010_CER": "Hey, Cheshire.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_15_COL": "Thanks for saving our friends!\r\nThis is some thanks from everyone!",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0034_003_H34": "Thanks, I'll head to the hideaway now. \r\nLet me sing a little for you \r\nwhen I feel better.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_50_H36": "Those faeries are atrocious!\r\nThey almost cut off my poor little head!",
  "CORE_HTDMQUEST_TXT_0034": "Nnn...My throat is killing me.\r\nYou don't have any medicine, \r\ndo you?",
  "CORE_POSEMENU_TXT_07": "Select a save file.",
  "AC_NARRATION220_0010": "A giant faerie fort, towering in the forest shadows.",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CHESHIRE_TXT_05": "Unlock requirements:\r\nSee all of Jeanne's heroics and...",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_60_FAS": "Why don't you visit the hideaway sometimes?\r\nI'm sure all the wisps would be \r\nso happy to see you.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0029_001_H29": "I'm just so...tired. Everything's a chore.\r\nMedicine? Just do it quick, okay?",
  "AC_CEREZA060_0050": "Can't even control the elements...pathetic.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_113": "Received \"A Pesky Demon\" \r\ncostume.",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_22": "Evasion",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_31": "Protection",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0023_003_H23": "Wow, real food! Thanks! I was\r\nso hungry I almost ate you.",
  "CORE_SNPSS_1050": "Cereza is asked by the boy \r\nfrom her dreams to destroy \r\nfour Elemental Cores somewhere\r\nin the forest. With this new \r\ngoal, she and Cheshire seek \r\nthe white wolf again.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_06_COL": "All the other wisps do so much to help...\r\nI've really got to start doing better too.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_008": "Data from this slot will be\r\nloaded and any current progress\r\nnot saved will be erased. \r\nProceed?",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_39": "Rotation - Trial",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_66_FAS": "Your next destination is a bit out \r\nof the way. Here, I'll show you.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_09_COL": "Hideaway rule #1: Don't mix work\r\nand play. That's our only rule!",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_155": "If you change your mind, these\r\nsettings can be changed any time\r\nfrom the Options menu.",
  "CORE_ARCHIVE_TXT_02": "The enemies that stand before Cereza.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0039_003_H39": "Thanks, witch lady. I found some food\r\ntoo, so I think it might be time to \r\nstart heading back.",
  "AC_NARRATION230_0020": "It has stood as a symbol of the \r\nfaerie kings of Avalon for generations.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_69_FAS": "The white wolf seems close by.\r\nDo you see any tracks he's left?",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_13_COL": "We added to the hideaway some, \r\ndid you notice? There's even \r\nmore places to play now!",
  "CORE_SNPSS_6040": "Cereza's time in Avalon \r\nhelped her grow in many \r\nways. Keeping the memories\r\nof her friends close to her \r\nheart, she sets off to \r\na new journey.",
  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_151": "Adjust how Cheshire's special attacks work.\r\nSpecial attacks usually consume magic, but \r\nif you want a more laid-back experience,\r\nselect \"Always Full\" to use them with no limit.",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_23_COL": "You two are our heroes!\r\nCome back any time you like! \r\nWe'll be waiting!",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_59_FAS": "I heard Colm wanted to see you.\r\nSaid there was something he wanted to say.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_47_H33": "Hmph, saved at last. Guess I should \r\nbe thankful. If only those faeries \r\nwould settle down some.",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_56_FAS": "So the next core's at the lake's bottom,\r\nand you need to climb a tall tree \r\nto get there.",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0026_002_H26": "It's terrible the faeries must \r\nact so horrible. If only we could \r\nall get along..."
}
